  "notes": "A humped plank footbridge 16 m long and 2 m wide on paired piles, running from the anchor toward local +Z: the middle stands 2.5 m over the water with no posts under it, so a kayak passes beneath, and 1.25 m handrails run both sides with a lantern at each side of the crown. Base sea; it carves nothing.",
